   "key": "func CoachCueSpeechTests.testALineStoppedWhileClaimingGivesItsHoldBack()",
   "hash": "4e90213d17dc7ba9",
   "does": "Speaks one line through CoachCueSpeech over a counting session whose activation is held open: speak clears the fallback and the line counts as busy; once the claim has reached the session (one activation, none given back) the line is stopped, so stopAll lands while the claim is in flight, and it is no longer busy; the activation is then released, and once the claim loop and the manager queue have run the session was activated once and deactivated once (the dropped line's hold given back) and nothing was spoken.",
